<!-- SCRIPT GENERATION TASK PROMPT -->
Write creative, engaging voiceover scripts for each segment of: "{{ video_title }}"

<narrative_arc>
{{ narrative_arc }}
</narrative_arc>

<segments>
{% for segment in segments %}
Segment {{ loop.index }}: {{ segment.title }}
- Duration: {{ segment.duration }}s (target ~{{ (segment.duration * 2.5) | round(0) | int }} words)
- Purpose: {{ segment.purpose }}
- Hook: {{ segment.narrative_hook }}
{% if loop.index > 1 %}- Transition from previous: {{ segment.transition_from_previous }}{% endif %}
- Key points: {{ segment.key_points | join(', ') }}
- Content guidance: {{ segment.content }}
{% if loop.index < segments|length %}- Transition to next: {{ segment.transition_to_next }}{% endif %}

{% endfor %}
</segments>

<requirements>
- Create a separate script for each segment in order
- Each script should be self-contained yet connect smoothly via transitions
- Honor each segment's hook, purpose, and transitions
- Target word count per segment: segment_duration × 2.5 words
- Write as natural, energetic speech with personality
- Avoid forbidden phrases and generic language
- **Be creative**: Use vivid metaphors, compelling analogies, memorable phrasing
- **Be expressive**: Vary sentence structure, use strong verbs, create rhythm
- **Be engaging**: Hook viewers, build tension, deliver satisfying insights
- **Maintain continuity**: Each segment flows naturally from previous, leads into next
- Output JSON with title and segments array (each with segment_number and script)
</requirements>